  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7302.07 “Preliminary damage assessment (PDA)” means an assessment of the impact and magnitude of damage as outlined in 44 USC § 206.33.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
